## Final artifact
`final_solution/submission.csv` — md5 **`df03e1a4eac8a1a4e8855cb36f4dd662`**, byte-identical to `castor_iota/submission_6m_castor.csv` and `achernar_tau/submission_6m.csv` (three independent assemblies agree).
